  "notes": [
    "GT2, GT4, Cup, Challenge, Super Trofeo and TCX cars are outside this GT3 catalog, even if a car's name contains GT3.",
    "Season, game version, BoP, weather and setup are session conditions, not additional car or circuit identities. PC and console physics versions must not be assumed identical.",
    "The official 2025 season update adds liveries and drivers on Steam, not additional car variants or circuits; console availability of that update is not asserted.",
    "The official current contents page omits Lexus and labels the updated Mercedes-AMG as 2023. Lexus is confirmed by official patch notes; the Mercedes 2020 Evo received a physics update, not a separate car slot.",
    "Nurburgring GP and Nurburgring 24h are different layouts. The 24h layout combines GP and Nordschleife; a standalone Nordschleife or tourist layout is not an ACC circuit entry.",
    "Season-dependent grip and BoP remain distinct comparison conditions even where the circuit layout is the same. PS4 and Xbox One content parity is not asserted."
